# ---------------------------------------------------------------- financial data
# Deny by default. A real bank or card export dropped anywhere under data/ must
# not be committable, whatever it is named - the previous rule protected exactly
# one filename, which only helps if you remember to use that filename. The two
# committed files are re-allowed explicitly.
backend/data/**
!backend/data/**/
!backend/data/eval/README.md
!backend/data/eval/transactions.example.csv

